{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38605","headline":"赋得欲晓看妆面 · 吴融","name":"赋得欲晓看妆面","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胧胧欲曙色，隐隐辨残妆。\n月始云中出，花犹雾里藏。\n眉边全失翠，额畔半留黄。\n转入金屏影，隈侵角枕光。\n有蝉隳鬓样，无燕着𨥁行\n十二峯前梦，如何不断肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}